# WP-HASH-SET (UE 5.5 UWorldPartitionRuntimeHashSet): the world states RUNTIME PARTITIONS (WP format v3) - each a
# Name, a Type (LHGrid = the square hierarchical grid; Persistent = always loaded) and its own ordered HLOD setups
# (UE FRuntimePartitionDesc::HLODSetups: setup 0 stands in for the cells, setup 1 for setup 0's HLOD cells).
# The planner, the cook and the streamer ask the partition's class (Rules::IRuntimePartition), never its type.
# Lead: run scripts/Dev/migrate.sh --write first (WPAR 2 -> 3: Grids -> LHGrid partitions, HLODLayer + ParentLayer
# chains -> HLOD setups). WP_Protocol's Main grid then states setups HLOD_Main (Instancing, spatial) and
# HLOD_Main_Far; the Дано below makes the far one MeshSimplify and adds the Persistent partition holding building
# 200222 "Main C10_04_B00" (~1.1 km from the centre, so it would otherwise stream as an HLOD): it gets a RuntimeGrid
# block (UE AActor::RuntimeGrid) by add-component, since `set` writes only a component the entity has. Not the
# player cube 9000001: it is a StreamingSource, always loaded by its component already (Reason Component), so on
# Persistent it would count nothing.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open World Partition"
Дано set world WorldPartition '{"RuntimePartitions":[{"Name":"Main","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":2500.0,"LoadingRange":20000.0,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"Near","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main"},{"Name":"Far","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Main_Far"}]},{"Name":"Foliage","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":1280.0,"LoadingRange":6400.0,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Foliage"}]},{"Name":"LandscapeTiles","Type":"LHGrid","LHGrid":{"CellSize":5000.0,"LoadingRange":51000.0,"Priority":0},"HLODSetups":[{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","HLODLayer":"HLOD_Landscape"}]},{"Name":"Persistent","Type":"Persistent"}],"HLODLayers":[{"Name":"HLOD_Main","Type":"Instancing","CellSize":51200.0,"LoadingRange":102400.0},{"Name":"HLOD_Main_Far","Type":"MeshSimplify","Settings":{"TrianglePercent":0.25}},{"Name":"HLOD_Foliage","Type":"Instancing"},{"Name":"HLOD_Landscape","Type":"Instancing"}],"ChunkRegionSize":100000.0}'
Дано add-component 200222 RuntimeGridData
Дано set 200222 RuntimeGridData.Grid "Persistent"
Дано run Action "Save Scene"
Дано run Scene "Build HLODs"
Дано wait-idle 2400
Тогда hashset_panel панель World Partition, раздел Runtime partitions: 4 строки, у Main/Foliage/LandscapeTiles тип LHGrid с размерами ячеек, у Persistent тип Persistent и прочерки вместо размеров; раздел HLOD setups per partition: Main (LHGrid) - HLOD0 'Near' = HLOD_Main, HLOD1 'Far' = HLOD_Main_Far; Persistent (Persistent) - "always loaded: no HLOD stands in for it"
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play"
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда advance 2
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,100000,-1000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-1,0.01
Когда advance 2
Тогда hashset_far вид сверху с 1 км над центром: ближние ячейки (до 200 м от игрока) настоящие здания, средние (до 1 км) - HLOD_Main инстансами, дальние - упрощённые блоки HLOD_Main_Far (MeshSimplify 25 %), на стыках ни дыр, ни двойных; игрок-куб 9000001 на месте; здание 200222 (Main C10_04_B00, ~1.1 км от центра) - полная модель, не HLOD; лог: в строке плана "persistent 1" и "partition 'Persistent' (Persistent)"
Когда run Action "Stop"
# No restore: the Дано above IS WP_Protocol's authored state from here on (the card's Дано - MainGrid with HLOD
# setups Near = Instancing and Far = MeshSimplify, a Persistent partition holding building 200222); it is saved.
